Setup a Sublime Haskell Projoect

1) Install cabal
OSX:	
	$ brew install cabal-install
Debian:
	# apt-get install cabal

2) Install hdevtools and hsdev
	$ cabal install happy			#unlisted dependency of hsdev
	$ cabal install hdevtools
	$ cabal install hsdev

3) Follow the steps here to install SublimeHaskell and setup the project
http://gettingsharper.de/2012/10/04/getting-started-with-using-sublimehaskell-and-cabal/

4) Open the config file of the plugin
/Users/[User]/Library/Application Support/Sublime Text 3/Packages/SublimeHaskell

And search the option add_to_PATH, then add the path of the cabal bin applications to the list
/Users/[User]/.cabal/bin

5) To compile the project run ./build.sh